        description: "Owner or administrator console session. Returns only project_auth.* entries of the platform's hash-chained audit log for the caller's organization, this project and this environment. App users appear as project_auth_user:<id>, failed sign-ins with an unknown email as anonymous; emails, passwords and tokens are never recorded. Chain hashes are not returned. The cursor is the id of the last returned event.",
